// Data set -> its data elements, via the nested `dataSetElements.dataElement` link.
//
// A dataSet relates to data elements through a join entity (dataSetElements), each
// holding a `dataElement`. Chained navigation walks straight through it — another
// "join" expressed as nested field access on a single source.
dataSets
  | transform { id: id, name: name, elements: dataSetElements.dataElement.select({ id: id, name: name }) }
  | limit 10
